  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">YAL - Rhodah - Mr. Gift</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Supply Chain.Beneficiaries: YAL Youth 547 of which 284 are women..The grant will be used to expand the market of fresh flowers to at least 500 customers daily by improving distribution networks across Kampala. Mr. Gift will aim at maximizing the effectiveness of the old supply chain from the point of delivery at their packaging center to the point of sale to customers. They will source from 50 additional small holder farmers and hire delivery drivers. ..Funding: .The grant funds will be used to: (a) motorbike to increase deliveries; (b) advertising campaign to gain visibility; (c) training with small folder farmers on best practices; and (d) equipment upgrades for improved packaging. .</narrative>
  </description>
